msgid "# Dots3 Note"
msgstr "# Dots3 Note"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"Dots3 Note is a large language model based on the Dots3 Note MoE + MLA "
"architecture, with audio and vision multimodal encoders. The text, image, "
"and audio forms are not mutually exclusive and can be enabled "
"simultaneously; when device memory is limited, it is recommended to enable "
"the required forms on demand. The forms cannot be switched dynamically "
"within the same process, and the service must be restarted when switching."
msgstr ""
"Dots3 Note 是采用 Dots3 Note MoE + MLA 架构的大语言模型，并带有 audio 与 vision "
"多模态编码器。text、image、audio "
"三种形态并不是互斥的，可以同时开启；在显存有限的情况下，建议按需开启所需形态。形态不能在同一进程中动态切换，切换时需要重启服务。"

msgid "| Form | Input | Typical scenario | Modal configuration |"
msgstr "| 形态 | 输入 | 典型场景 | 模态配置 |"

msgid ""
"| text-only | Text | Long-context dialogue, text reasoning | `--language-"
"model-only` |"
msgstr "| text-only | 文本 | 长上下文对话、文本推理 | `--language-model-only` |"

msgid ""
"| image | Text + images (≤ 7 per request) | MMMU and other vision tasks | "
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":7,\"video\":0,\"audio\":0}'` |"
msgstr ""
"| image | 文本 + 图片（每请求 ≤ 7 张） | MMMU 等视觉任务 | `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":7,\"video\":0,\"audio\":0}'` |"

msgid ""
"| audio | Text + audio | MMAR and other audio tasks | `--limit-mm-per-prompt"
" '{\"image\":0,\"video\":0,\"audio\":1}'` |"
msgstr ""
"| audio | 文本 + 音频 | MMAR 等音频任务 | `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":0,\"video\":0,\"audio\":1}'` |"

msgid ""
"If you only need to verify text capability, select text-only; select image "
"for vision tasks such as MMMU; select audio for audio tasks such as MMAR. "
"After a form is enabled, all subsequent startup and functional validation "
"commands must use the same form."
msgstr ""
"如果只验证文本能力，选择 text-only；验证 MMMU 等视觉任务时选择 image；验证 MMAR 等音频任务时选择 "
"audio。启用某种形态后，后续的启动和功能验证命令必须使用同一形态。"

msgid ""
"This document is validated and written based on **vLLM-Ascend v0.22.1rc1** "
"(with vLLM 0.22.1). Dots3 Note is fully supported in this version, and all "
"**v0.22.1rc1 and later versions** can run stably."
msgstr ""
"本文档基于 **vLLM-Ascend v0.22.1rc1**（配套 vLLM 0.22.1）验证并编写。Dots3 Note "
"在此版本中完全支持，**v0.22.1rc1 及后续版本**均可稳定运行。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持特性"

msgid "Dots3 Note supports the following features on vLLM-Ascend:"
msgstr "Dots3 Note 在 vLLM-Ascend 上支持以下特性："

msgid "| Feature | Support | Description |"
msgstr "| 特性 | 支持 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| Model architecture | Dots3 Note MoE + MLA | MoE mixture of experts + "
"multi-head latent attention |"
msgstr "| 模型架构 | Dots3 Note MoE + MLA | MoE 混合专家 + 多头潜在注意力 |"

msgid ""
"| Multimodal | audio + vision | Audio / vision encoders, enabled per form "
"(see §5.1) |"
msgstr "| 多模态 | audio + vision | 音频 / 视觉编码器，按形态分别启用（见 §5.1）|"

msgid ""
"| MTP speculative decoding | ✅ (text-only / audio) | MTP3 + draft eager; "
"disabled for image (Model Runner V1 limitation) |"
msgstr ""
"| MTP 投机解码 | ✅（text-only / audio）| MTP3 + draft eager；image 形态关闭（Model "
"Runner V1 限制）|"

msgid ""
"> This chapter describes the validation scope and does not mean that all "
"hardware and software version combinations are covered. When reproducing the"
" results in this document, prefer the validation environment and component "
"versions listed in Chapters 3–4."
msgstr "> 本章描述的是验证范围，不代表所有硬件和软件版本组合均已覆盖。复现本文结果时，应优先使用第 3～4 章列出的验证环境和组件版本。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前置条件"

msgid ""
"Before installation, complete the checks in this chapter on the host. Only "
"after the hardware, drivers, firmware, and model weights are all ready "
"should you proceed to Chapter 4."
msgstr "开始安装前，请先在宿主机完成本章检查。只有硬件、驱动、固件和模型权重均就绪后，才进入第 4 章。"

msgid "### 3.1 Hardware Introduction"
msgstr "### 3.1 硬件介绍"

msgid "The validation environment of this document is as follows:"
msgstr "本文验证环境如下："

msgid "| Item | Specification |"
msgstr "| 项 | 规格 |"

msgid ""
"| Server | Single-node Atlas A3 inference series (Atlas 800I A3, board model"
" `IT22HMDA_4_S`) |"
msgstr "| 服务器 | 单机 Atlas A3 推理系列（Atlas 800I A3，板卡型号 `IT22HMDA_4_S`）|"

msgid ""
"| NPU | Atlas A3 products (8 cards, each dual-die (2 chips)), 16 chips in "
"total, corresponding to `/dev/davinci[0-15]` |"
msgstr ""
"| NPU | Atlas A3 系列产品（8 张卡，每张双 die（2 芯片）），共 16 芯片，对应 `/dev/davinci[0-15]` |"

msgid "| Memory | 64 GB device memory per chip |"
msgstr "| 显存 | 每芯片 64 GB 显存 |"

msgid "| Chip software version | SOC_VERSION = `ascend910_9391` (A3 series) |"
msgstr "| 芯片软件版本 | SOC_VERSION = `ascend910_9391`（A3 系列）|"

msgid "| Host form | Single-node deployment (not multi-node) |"
msgstr "| 主机形态 | 单机部署（非多节点）|"

msgid "Run the following checks on the host:"
msgstr "在宿主机执行以下检查："

msgid ""
"Pass criteria: `npu-smi info` recognizes 8 cards with 16 chips in total, and"
" all chips report normal device memory status; the device files required for"
" container startup all exist. If the number of devices or device files "
"differs from this document, adjust the device mapping in Section 4.2 and the"
" subsequent parallel parameters accordingly; the TP16 configuration cannot "
"be applied directly."
msgstr ""
"通过标准：`npu-smi info` 能识别 8 张卡、共 16 "
"个芯片，所有芯片的显存状态正常；同时，容器启动所需的设备文件均存在。若设备数量或设备文件与本文不同，需要同步调整第 4.2 "
"节中的设备映射及后续并行参数，不能直接照用 TP16 配置。"

msgid "### 3.2 Driver Version Requirements"
msgstr "### 3.2 驱动版本要求"

msgid "The software environment validated in this document is as follows:"
msgstr "本文验证的软件环境如下："

msgid "| Item | Version |"
msgstr "| 项 | 版本 |"

msgid "| NPU driver (npu-smi) | 26.0.rc1 |"
msgstr "| NPU 驱动（npu-smi）| 26.0.rc1 |"

msgid ""
"The driver and firmware are installed on the host and mounted into the "
"container through paths such as `/usr/local/Ascend/driver/version.info` and "
"`/usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64/`. First run the following on the host:"
msgstr ""
"驱动与固件由宿主机安装，并通过 "
"`/usr/local/Ascend/driver/version.info`、`/usr/local/Ascend/driver/lib64/` "
"等路径挂载进容器。先在宿主机运行："

msgid ""
"If `npu-smi info` output shows 8 cards with 16 chips in total and normal "
"device memory, the host-side NPU is ready. After entering the container, run"
" `npu-smi info` again to confirm that the devices and driver are also "
"visible inside the container."
msgstr ""
"`npu-smi info` 输出中显示 8 张卡、共 16 个芯片且显存正常，即表示宿主机侧 NPU 就绪。进入容器后还需要再次执行 `npu-smi"
" info`，确认设备和驱动挂载在容器内同样可见。"

msgid "### 3.3 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.3 模型权重"

msgid ""
"Ensure that the model weights are fully downloaded and confirm their visible"
" path **inside the container**. All subsequent startup commands reuse the "
"following variables:"
msgstr "确保模型权重已经下载完整，并明确它在**容器内**的可见路径。后续所有启动命令都复用以下变量："

msgid ""
"If the model weights reside on the host, mount the host directory into the "
"container at container startup, and set `MODEL_PATH` to the in-container "
"path after mounting. `SERVED_NAME` must be consistent with the model name in"
" the client requests in Chapter 6; otherwise the requests return 404."
msgstr ""
"如果模型权重位于宿主机，需要在启动容器时将宿主机目录挂载到容器，并把 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为挂载后的容器内路径。`SERVED_NAME` "
"必须与第 6 章客户端请求中的模型名保持一致，否则请求会返回 404。"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid ""
"This chapter provides a single installation method: use the official "
"prebuilt image directly."
msgstr "本章只提供一种安装方式：直接使用官方预构建镜像。"

msgid "### 4.1 Components"
msgstr "### 4.1 组件介绍"

msgid "| Component | Version | Description |"
msgstr "| 组件 | 版本 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| vLLM-Ascend (vllm-ascend) | 0.22.1rc1 | Community-maintained Ascend NPU "
"hardware plugin that connects the NPU to vLLM through the vLLM hardware "
"pluggable interface, aligned with the vLLM version |"
msgstr ""
"| vLLM-Ascend（vllm-ascend）| 0.22.1rc1 | 社区维护的 Ascend NPU 硬件插件，通过 vLLM "
"硬件可插拔接口将 NPU 接入 vLLM，与 vLLM 版本对齐 |"

msgid ""
"| CANN | 9.0.0 | Ascend software stack (development kit + operator "
"packages), in-container path `/usr/local/Ascend/cann-9.0.0` |"
msgstr ""
"| CANN | 9.0.0 | 昇腾软件栈（开发套件 + 算子包），容器内路径 `/usr/local/Ascend/cann-9.0.0` |"

msgid ""
"> This document recommends the all-in-one image `quay.io/ascend/vllm-"
"ascend:dots3-note-prev-a3-openeuler`. The image bundles vLLM, vLLM-Ascend, "
"torch-npu, and CANN, so no separate installation is required."
msgstr ""
"> 本文推荐使用 all-in-one 镜像 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-"
"prev-a3-openeuler`。该镜像内置 vLLM、vLLM-Ascend、torch-npu 和 CANN，无需自行安装。"

msgid "### 4.2 Image Acquisition and Build"
msgstr "### 4.2 镜像获取与构建"

msgid ""
"The runtime uses the official vLLM-Ascend all-in-one image, which already "
"contains vLLM, vLLM-Ascend, torch-npu, CANN, and NNAL. Choose the image "
"matching your hardware series and OS:"
msgstr ""
"运行环境使用 vLLM-Ascend 官方 all-in-one 镜像，镜像中已包含 vLLM、vLLM-Ascend、torch-npu、CANN 和"
" NNAL。请根据硬件系列和 OS 选择镜像："

msgid "| Image | Hardware | OS |"
msgstr "| 镜像 | 硬件 | OS |"

msgid "| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev` | Atlas A2 | Ubuntu |"
msgstr "| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev` | Atlas A2 | Ubuntu |"

msgid ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-openeuler` | Atlas A2 | "
"openEuler |"
msgstr ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-openeuler` | Atlas A2 | "
"openEuler |"

msgid ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-a3` | Atlas A3 | Ubuntu |"
msgstr ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-a3` | Atlas A3 | Ubuntu |"

msgid ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-a3-openeuler` | Atlas A3 | "
"openEuler |"
msgstr ""
"| `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:dots3-note-prev-a3-openeuler` | Atlas A3 | "
"openEuler |"

msgid "**Use the official prebuilt image directly (recommended)**"
msgstr "**直接使用官方预构建镜像（推荐）**"

msgid "The following commands are all executed on the host:"
msgstr "以下命令均在宿主机执行："

msgid "Before startup, set the actual path of the model weights on the host:"
msgstr "启动前，先设置模型权重在宿主机上的实际路径："

msgid ""
"Atlas A3 requires mapping all 16 `davinci` devices and mounting the drivers."
" The command below has expanded all devices and can be copied directly; if "
"the host directories differ, adjust the mount source paths first:"
msgstr ""
"Atlas A3 需要映射全部 16 个 `davinci` "
"设备并挂载驱动。下面的命令已展开全部设备，可直接复制；如宿主机目录不同，请先调整挂载源路径："

msgid ""
"The default working directory of the container is `/workspace`, and vLLM and"
" vLLM-Ascend are installed in development mode (`pip install -e`). After "
"entering the container, set the paths and service name shared by subsequent "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"容器默认工作目录为 `/workspace`，vLLM 与 vLLM-Ascend 已按开发模式（`pip install "
"-e`）安装。进入容器后，设置后续命令共用的路径和服务名："

msgid ""
"If you need to read local image, audio, or other media files later, add the "
"corresponding read-only directory mounts at `docker run` time, and make sure"
" Chapters 5 and 6 use in-container paths."
msgstr ""
"如果后续需要读取本地图片、音频等媒体文件，还应在 `docker run` 时增加相应的只读目录挂载，并确保第 5、6 章使用的是容器内路径。"

msgid ""
"After entering the container, complete the following minimal checks before "
"continuing with the deployment:"
msgstr "进入容器后，应先完成以下最小检查，再继续部署："

msgid "### 4.3 Environment Variables"
msgstr "### 4.3 环境变量"

msgid ""
"Set the following environment variables inside the container before starting"
" the service. They are common to all three deployment forms; the variable "
"descriptions come from the official vLLM-Ascend documentation and common "
"practice:"
msgstr "在容器内、启动服务前设置以下环境变量。三种部署形态通用；变量说明来自 vLLM-Ascend 官方文档与常见实践："

msgid "| Variable | Description |"
msgstr "| 变量 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` | Specifies the NPU device IDs visible to the "
"process (all 16 chips visible) |"
msgstr "| `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` | 指定对进程可见的 NPU 设备编号（16 芯片全部可见）|"

msgid ""
"| `LD_PRELOAD` (jemalloc) | Preloads the jemalloc memory allocator to reduce"
" memory fragmentation in multi-threaded scenarios |"
msgstr "| `LD_PRELOAD`（jemalloc）| 预加载 jemalloc 内存分配器，减少多线程内存碎片 |"

msgid ""
"| `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True` | Enables the virtual "
"memory feature to mitigate fragmentation caused by dynamic memory size "
"adjustments during inference (official OOM troubleshooting recommendation) |"
msgstr ""
"| `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True` | "
"启用虚拟内存特性，缓解推理过程中动态内存大小调整引起的碎片化（官方 OOM 排障建议）|"

msgid ""
"| `TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE=1` | Enables the NPU task queue to dispatch operators "
"asynchronously |"
msgstr "| `TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE=1` | 启用 NPU 任务队列，异步下发算子 |"

msgid ""
"| `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1` | Enables CPU core binding to reduce cross-NUMA "
"access |"
msgstr "| `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1` | 启用 CPU 核绑定，减少跨 NUMA 访问 |"

msgid ""
"| `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV` | Expands collective communication operators "
"to AIV cores to improve multi-card communication bandwidth (example "
"configuration from official tutorials) |"
msgstr "| `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=AIV` | 集合通信算子展开到 AIV 核，提升多卡通信带宽（官方教程示例配置）|"

msgid ""
"After setting, first confirm the key variables and the preloaded library:"
msgstr "设置后先确认关键变量和预加载库："

msgid ""
"If the jemalloc path does not exist in the selected image, install it first "
"or change it to the actual path in the image; do not start the service with "
"an invalid `LD_PRELOAD`."
msgstr "如果 jemalloc 路径在所选镜像中不存在，应先安装或改成镜像中的实际路径，不能带着无效的 `LD_PRELOAD` 启动服务。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid ""
"This chapter starts one service form at a time. For the first deployment, it"
" is recommended to start text-only first to complete the basic pipeline "
"validation, then switch to image or audio according to the test objective."
msgstr "本章一次启动一种服务形态。首次部署建议先启动 text-only 完成基础链路验证，再根据测试目标切换到 image 或 audio。"

msgid "### 5.1 Deployment Modes"
msgstr "### 5.1 部署模式"

msgid "The three deployment forms are compared as follows:"
msgstr "三种部署形态对比如下："

msgid ""
"| Form | Input | Typical scenario | Modal configuration | Context | KV cache"
" | MTP | Weight per worker |"
msgstr "| 形态 | 输入 | 典型场景 | 模态配置 | 上下文 | KV 方式 | MTP | 每 worker 权重加载 |"

msgid ""
"| text-only | Text | Long-context dialogue, text reasoning | `--language-"
"model-only` | 32768 | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92` | ✅ MTP3 | 36.26 GB |"
msgstr ""
"| text-only | 文本 | 长上下文对话、文本推理 | `--language-model-only` | 32768 | `--gpu-"
"memory-utilization 0.92` | ✅ MTP3 | 36.26 GB |"

msgid ""
"| image | Text + images (≤ 7 per request) | MMMU and other vision tasks | "
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":7,\"video\":0,\"audio\":0}'` | 32768 | "
"`--kv-cache-memory-bytes 2816M` | ❌ | ~48.8 GB (+12.5 GB) |"
msgstr ""
"| image | 文本 + 图片（≤ 7 张/请求）| MMMU 等视觉任务 | `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":7,\"video\":0,\"audio\":0}'` | 32768 | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes "
"2816M` | ❌ | ~48.8 GB（+12.5 GB）|"

msgid ""
"| audio | Text + audio | MMAR and other audio tasks | `--limit-mm-per-prompt"
" '{\"image\":0,\"video\":0,\"audio\":1}'` | 4096 | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes "
"4G` | ✅ MTP3 | 37.88 GB (+1.62 GB) |"
msgstr ""
"| audio | 文本 + 音频 | MMAR 等音频任务 | `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":0,\"video\":0,\"audio\":1}'` | 4096 | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes "
"4G` | ✅ MTP3 | 37.88 GB（+1.62 GB）|"

msgid ""
"All three forms share 16 chips with TP16 + MoE expert parallelism (EP16). "
"Before startup, confirm:"
msgstr "三种形态共用 16 芯片 TP16 + MoE 专家并行（EP16）。启动前确认："

msgid ""
"When switching forms, first press `Ctrl+C` in the service terminal to stop "
"the process normally, then check whether there are residual workers. Only "
"when the normal stop does not clean up completely, use the following "
"commands in order:"
msgstr ""
"切换形态时，先在服务终端按 `Ctrl+C` 正常停止进程，再检查是否仍有残留 Worker。只有正常停止未清理干净时，才依次使用以下命令："

msgid ""
"After confirming that the old process has exited and port 8000 is released, "
"start another form to avoid residual processes occupying NPU memory."
msgstr "确认旧进程已经退出、8000 端口已释放后，再启动另一形态，避免残留进程占用 NPU 显存。"

msgid ""
"> **Concurrency suggestion**: text-only / audio use `--max-num-seqs 4`; "
"image can use `--max-num-seqs 16`. The 2816M KV for the image form is the "
"upper limit allowed by the FusedMC2 computation peak under 16 concurrency "
"(about 3.64 GiB per card); increasing KV to ≥3072M will cause OOM. If a "
"larger KV capacity is needed, reduce the concurrency to 8."
msgstr ""
"> **并发建议**：text-only / audio 使用 `--max-num-seqs 4`；image 可使用 `--max-num-seqs"
" 16`。image 形态的 KV 2816M 是 16 并发下 FusedMC2 计算峰值（约 3.64 GiB/卡）允许的上限，KV 调大到 "
"≥3072M 会 OOM；如果需要更大的 KV 容量，可将并发降为 8。"

msgid "### 5.2 text-only Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 text-only 在线部署"

msgid ""
"Suitable for pure text dialogue, mathematical reasoning, and long-context "
"scenarios. Inside the container, confirm that the environment variables in "
"Section 4.3 have been set, then start:"
msgstr "适用于纯文本对话、数学推理和长上下文场景。在容器内确认已执行第 4.3 节环境变量设置，然后启动："

msgid ""
"Keep this terminal running. After seeing the success log listed in Section "
"5.6, run the health check in another container terminal or host terminal, "
"then proceed to Section 6.1."
msgstr "保持该终端运行。看到第 5.6 节列出的成功日志后，在另一个容器终端或宿主机终端执行健康检查，再进入第 6.1 节。"

msgid "### 5.3 image Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.3 image 在线部署"

msgid ""
"The vision form disables MTP (Model Runner V1 limitation) and forces chunked"
" vision prefill to avoid peak OOM. `MEDIA_DIR` must be an in-container path "
"and must contain the test images in Section 6.2:"
msgstr ""
"视觉形态关闭 MTP（Model Runner V1 限制），并强制视觉预填充分块，避免峰值 OOM。`MEDIA_DIR` 必须是容器内路径，且包含第"
" 6.2 节测试图片："

msgid ""
"Keep this terminal running. After passing the health check in Section 5.6, "
"proceed to Section 6.2."
msgstr "保持该终端运行。通过第 5.6 节健康检查后，再进入第 6.2 节。"

msgid "### 5.4 audio Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.4 audio 在线部署"

msgid ""
"`MEDIA_ROOT` must be an in-container path and cover the local audio "
"directory that the service needs to read:"
msgstr "`MEDIA_ROOT` 必须是容器内路径，且覆盖服务需要读取的本地音频目录："

msgid "Start inside the container:"
msgstr "在容器内启动："

msgid ""
"Keep this terminal running. After passing the health check in Section 5.6, "
"proceed to Section 6.3."
msgstr "保持该终端运行。通过第 5.6 节健康检查后，再进入第 6.3 节。"

msgid "### 5.5 Parameter Description"
msgstr "### 5.5 启动参数说明"

msgid ""
"The parameter classification and descriptions refer to the vLLM official "
"[Engine "
"Arguments](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/) "
"documentation (engine arguments of `vllm serve`) and the vLLM-Ascend "
"documentation. The tables below cover all parameters used by the three "
"forms; when troubleshooting, first check this section, then modify the "
"startup command."
msgstr ""
"参数分类与描述参考 vLLM 官方 [Engine "
"Arguments](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/) "
"文档（`vllm serve` 的引擎参数）与 vLLM-Ascend 文档。以下表格覆盖三种形态用到的全部参数；排障时先核对本节，再修改启动命令。"

msgid "#### 5.5.1 Common Parameters (used by all three forms)"
msgstr "#### 5.5.1 通用参数（三种形态均使用）"

msgid ""
"| `--served-model-name` | `dots3_note` | The model name exposed by the API; "
"client requests must use this name (the default `default` returns 404) |"
msgstr ""
"| `--served-model-name` | `dots3_note` | API 中对外暴露的模型名，客户端请求必须使用该名称（默认 "
"`default` 会 404）|"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | On | MoE layers use expert parallelism "
"instead of tensor parallelism; each rank loads only the expert weights of "
"its own EP shard |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | 开 | MoE 层使用专家并行代替张量并行，各 rank 只加载本 EP 分片的专家权重 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `--safetensors-load-strategy` | `lazy` | safetensors weight loading "
"strategy: `lazy` means memory-mapped, on-demand loading from files, reducing"
" peak startup memory |"
msgstr ""
"| `--safetensors-load-strategy` | `lazy` | safetensors 权重加载策略：`lazy` "
"表示从文件内存映射、按需加载，降低启动峰值显存 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-prefix-caching` | On | Automatic prefix caching; similar prompts"
" reuse the KV cache, improving throughput |"
msgstr "| `--enable-prefix-caching` | 开 | 自动前缀缓存，相似 prompt 复用 KV cache，提升吞吐 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-chunked-prefill` | On | Chunked prefill to prevent a single long"
" request from occupying the whole batch, reducing TTFT fluctuation |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-chunked-prefill` | 开 | 预填充分块，避免单个长请求占满整个 batch，降低 TTFT 波动 |"

msgid ""
"| `--async-scheduling` | On | Asynchronous scheduling, decoupling scheduling"
" from inference, improving throughput |"
msgstr "| `--async-scheduling` | 开 | 异步调度，调度与推理解耦，提升吞吐 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs` | 4 for text-only / audio; 16 for image | Maximum number "
"of concurrent sequences per batch; should match the client concurrency and "
"the memory budget of the corresponding form |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-seqs` | text-only / audio 为 4；image 为 16 | "
"单批最大并发序列数；应与客户端并发及对应形态的显存预算匹配 |"

msgid ""
"| `--generation-config` | `vllm` | Generation config source: `vllm` means "
"not loading the model's own generation config and using vLLM defaults |"
msgstr ""
"| `--generation-config` | `vllm` | 生成配置来源：`vllm` 表示不加载模型自带 generation "
"config，使用 vLLM 默认 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config` | see §5.5.4 | Compilation / graph capture "
"configuration (`VLLM_COMPILE`, `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`, capture sizes) |"
msgstr ""
"| `--compilation-config` | 见 §5.5.4 | "
"编译/图捕获配置（`VLLM_COMPILE`、`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`、capture sizes）|"

msgid ""
"| `--additional-config` | see §5.5.4 | vLLM-Ascend additional configuration "
"(FlashComm1 / FusedMC2) |"
msgstr ""
"| `--additional-config` | 见 §5.5.4 | vLLM-Ascend 附加配置（FlashComm1 / "
"FusedMC2）|"

msgid "#### 5.5.2 Modality-Related Parameters"
msgstr "#### 5.5.2 模态相关参数"

msgid "| Parameter | text-only | image | audio | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | text-only | image | audio | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `--limit-mm-per-prompt` | — | `{\"image\":7,...}` | `{\"audio\":1,...}` | "
"Upper limit of each modality input per request; when the corresponding "
"modality is `0`, that encoder is not loaded (see §5.1). image uses 7 because"
" up to 7 images per request are supported; for single-image scenarios, it "
"can be tightened to 1 |"
msgstr ""
"| `--limit-mm-per-prompt` | — | `{\"image\":7,...}` | `{\"audio\":1,...}` | "
"每请求各模态输入数量上限；对应模态为 `0` 时，该 encoder 不加载（见 §5.1）。image 使用 7 是支持单请求最多 7 "
"张图片；如果仅有单图场景，可收紧为 1 |"

msgid "#### 5.5.3 KV Cache Configuration"
msgstr "#### 5.5.3 KV cache 配置"

msgid "| Form | KV cache | Reason |"
msgstr "| 形态 | KV 方式 | 理由 |"

msgid ""
"| text-only | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92` | Automatic profiling, "
"validated |"
msgstr "| text-only | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92` | 自动 profiling，验证通过 |"

msgid ""
"| image | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 2816M` | FusedMC2 peak needs about 3.64 "
"GiB per card; too large a KV (3328M) causes OOM; combined with `--max-num-"
"batched-tokens 1024` to chunk large-image prefill |"
msgstr ""
"| image | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 2816M` | FusedMC2 峰值需要约 3.64 GiB/卡，KV "
"过大（3328M）会 OOM；配合 `--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` 将大图预填充分块 |"

msgid ""
"| audio | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 4G` | Single-request budget is about "
"1,131 tokens (text 360 + audio 259 + output 512); 1G provides only 2,220 "
"tokens, insufficient, while 4G provides 8,956 tokens (2.19x) |"
msgstr ""
"| audio | `--kv-cache-memory-bytes 4G` | 单请求预算约 1,131 tokens（文本 360 + 音频 259"
" + 输出 512）；1G 只有 2,220 tokens 不足，4G 可提供 8,956 tokens（2.19x）|"

msgid ""
"> **Why image/audio use explicit `--kv-cache-memory-bytes` (measured)**: automatic profiling under v0.22.1 can allocate a large KV (audio gets 21,565 tokens at 0.92 and 25,686 tokens at 0.95), but the actual peak memory during graph capture exceeds the limit and causes the worker to exit, with logs showing `Worker proc VllmWorker-* died unexpectedly`. Explicit KV is more conservative than automatic profiling and reserves headroom for the about 3.76 GiB peak of graph capture, so it is the currently validated stable approach.\n"
">\n"
"> If you insist on automatic profiling, you can set `VLLM_MEMORY_PROFILER_ESTIMATE_CUDAGRAPHS=0` to disable the ACL graph memory estimation and try again; this approach has not been validated on single modality and is not recommended as the default configuration for external deployment testing."
msgstr ""
"> **为什么 image/audio 使用显式 `--kv-cache-memory-bytes`（实测）**：自动 profiling 在 v0.22.1 下可以分配较大的 KV（audio 在 0.92 时得到 21,565 tokens，在 0.95 时得到 25,686 tokens），但实际 graph capture 阶段的峰值显存会超限并导致 worker 退出，日志表现为 `Worker proc VllmWorker-* died unexpectedly`。显式 KV 比自动 profiling 更保守，可为 graph capture 的约 3.76 GiB 峰值留出余量，因此是当前验证过的稳定方式。\n"
">\n"
"> 如果坚持使用自动 profiling，可设置 `VLLM_MEMORY_PROFILER_ESTIMATE_CUDAGRAPHS=0`，关闭 ACL graph 内存估算后再尝试；该方式尚未在单模态下验证，不建议作为对外部署测试的默认配置。"

msgid "#### 5.5.4 Compilation and vLLM-Ascend Additional Configuration"
msgstr "#### 5.5.4 编译与 vLLM-Ascend 附加配置"

msgid "| Parameter | Value | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 取值 | 说明 |"

msgid "| `--compilation-config.mode` | `VLLM_COMPILE` | Compilation mode |"
msgstr "| `--compilation-config.mode` | `VLLM_COMPILE` | 编译模式 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config.cudagraph_mode` | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` | ACL graph "
"captures only the decode stage, reducing capture peak memory |"
msgstr ""
"| `--compilation-config.cudagraph_mode` | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` | ACL graph 仅捕获"
" decode 阶段，降低捕获峰值显存 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config.cudagraph_capture_sizes` | text-only `[16]`; image "
"`[16]`; audio `[4,8,16]` | Graph capture batch sizes; TP16 + sequence "
"parallelism requires multiples of 16, and audio `[4,8]` are automatically "
"removed at startup |"
msgstr ""
"| `--compilation-config.cudagraph_capture_sizes` | text-only `[16]`；image "
"`[16]`；audio `[4,8,16]` | 图捕获 batch size；TP16 + 序列并行要求为 16 的倍数，audio 的 "
"`[4,8]` 在启动时会被自动剔除 |"

msgid ""
"| `--compilation-config.max_cudagraph_capture_size` | 16 (text-only / audio)"
" | Maximum graph capture batch size, `= max_num_seqs × (1 + "
"num_speculative_tokens) = 4 × 4` |"
msgstr ""
"| `--compilation-config.max_cudagraph_capture_size` | 16（text-only / audio）|"
" 最大图捕获 batch size，`= max_num_seqs × (1 + num_speculative_tokens) = 4 × 4` |"

msgid ""
"| `--additional-config.enable_flashcomm1` | `true` | Enables FlashComm1 "
"communication optimization (effective when TP ≥ 2 and under high "
"concurrency) |"
msgstr ""
"| `--additional-config.enable_flashcomm1` | `true` | 启用 FlashComm1 通信优化（TP ≥"
" 2、高并发时生效）|"

msgid ""
"| `--additional-config.enable_fused_mc2` | `1` | Enables FusedMC2 (fused "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine` / `mega_moe` operators for MoE) |"
msgstr ""
"| `--additional-config.enable_fused_mc2` | `1` | 启用 FusedMC2（MoE "
"`dispatch_ffn_combine` / `mega_moe` 融合算子）|"

msgid "### 5.6 Service Verification"
msgstr "### 5.6 服务验证"

msgid ""
"Do not judge startup success only by process existence. First wait for model"
" loading and graph capture to complete; the success log should contain:"
msgstr "不要仅以进程存在作为启动成功的判断。先等待模型加载和 graph capture 完成；成功日志应包含："

msgid "Then run the health check in another terminal:"
msgstr "然后在另一个终端执行健康检查："

msgid ""
"The returned result should contain the model name `dots3_note` and the "
"`max_model_len` of the corresponding form. At the same time, confirm that "
"the service terminal has no `worker died`, OOM, or continuous restart logs. "
"Only when both conditions are met is the service considered ready, and then "
"proceed to Chapter 6."
msgstr ""
"返回结果中应包含模型名 `dots3_note` 和对应形态的 `max_model_len`。同时确认服务终端没有 `worker died`、OOM"
" 或持续重启日志。只有满足这两个条件，才视为服务就绪并进入第 6 章。"

msgid ""
"If the health check fails, troubleshoot in the following order: whether the "
"service is still loading, whether port 8000 is listening, whether `--served-"
"model-name` is correct, and whether the service terminal shows NPU OOM or "
"abnormal worker exit."
msgstr ""
"如果健康检查失败，按以下顺序排查：服务是否仍在加载、8000 端口是否监听、`--served-model-name` 是否正确，以及服务终端是否出现 "
"NPU OOM 或 Worker 异常退出。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid ""
"The goal of functional verification is to use a real request to confirm that"
" the \"client → OpenAI-compatible interface → model inference → response\" "
"pipeline is usable. Only execute the subsection corresponding to the current"
" service form."
msgstr ""
"功能验证的目标是用一条真实请求确认“客户端 → OpenAI 兼容接口 → 模型推理 → 响应返回”链路可用。请只执行与当前服务形态对应的小节。"

msgid "### 6.1 text-only"
msgstr "### 6.1 text-only"

msgid "Execute in another terminal:"
msgstr "在另一个终端执行："

msgid ""
"Pass criteria: the HTTP request succeeds, the `model` in the response "
"matches the service name, and `choices[0].message.content` contains a valid "
"text answer."
msgstr ""
"通过标准：HTTP 请求成功，响应中的 `model` 与服务名一致，`choices[0].message.content` 包含有效文本答案。"

msgid "### 6.2 image"
msgstr "### 6.2 image"

msgid ""
"First confirm that the test image is within the `MEDIA_DIR` whitelist "
"configured in Section 5.3, and replace the path below with the actual file:"
msgstr "先确认测试图片位于第 5.3 节配置的 `MEDIA_DIR` 白名单内，并将下方路径替换为实际文件："

msgid ""
"Pass criteria: the HTTP request succeeds, the response contains valid text "
"related to the image content, and the service terminal shows no media path "
"rejection, HTTP 400, or OOM."
msgstr "通过标准：HTTP 请求成功，响应包含与图片内容相关的有效文本，服务终端没有媒体路径拒绝、HTTP 400 或 OOM。"

msgid ""
"> The local path must be within the `--allowed-local-media-path` whitelist; "
"base64 data URLs are submitted over HTTP and do not require the local path "
"whitelist."
msgstr ""
"> 本地路径必须位于 `--allowed-local-media-path` 白名单内；base64 data URL 通过 HTTP "
"提交，不需要本地路径白名单。"

msgid "### 6.3 audio"
msgstr "### 6.3 audio"

msgid ""
"First confirm that `/path/to/audio.wav` exists. The following command relies"
" on GNU coreutils that support `base64 -w0`:"
msgstr "先确认 `/path/to/audio.wav` 存在。以下命令依赖支持 `base64 -w0` 的 GNU coreutils："

msgid ""
"Pass criteria: the HTTP request succeeds, the response contains valid text "
"related to the audio content, and the service terminal shows no audio "
"decoding, HTTP 400, or OOM errors."
msgstr "通过标准：HTTP 请求成功，响应包含与音频内容相关的有效文本，服务终端没有音频解码、HTTP 400 或 OOM 错误。"

msgid "## 7 Accuracy Evaluation (Reference)"
msgstr "## 7 精度评测（参考）"

msgid ""
"> This chapter provides an accuracy evaluation guide for reference only. It "
"covers the GSM8K dataset, which is used to evaluate text-only math "
"reasoning. The evaluation commands in this chapter are for reference; the "
"deployment and service startup procedures in Chapters 3-5 are the "
"prerequisite for running them."
msgstr ""
"> 本章提供精度评测指导，仅供参考。本章覆盖 GSM8K 数据集，用于评测纯文本数学推理。本章中的评测命令仅供参考；第 3～5 "
"章的部署与服务启动流程是运行本章命令的前提。"

msgid "First install evalscope inside the container:"
msgstr "先在容器内安装 evalscope："

msgid "Then run a smoke test first, followed by the full evaluation:"
msgstr "先运行冒烟测试，再运行全量评测："

msgid ""
"> The built-in dataset requires access to ModelScope. For domestic networks,"
" set `export MODELSCOPE_API_URL=https://modelscope.cn` before running."
msgstr ""
"> 内置数据集需要访问 ModelScope。国内网络可在运行前设置 `export "
"MODELSCOPE_API_URL=https://modelscope.cn`。"

msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation (Reference)"
msgstr "## 8 性能评测（参考）"

msgid ""
"> This chapter provides a performance evaluation guide for reference only. "
"The evaluation methods and commands in this chapter are for reference; the "
"deployment and service startup procedures in Chapters 3-5 are the "
"prerequisite for running them."
msgstr "> 本章提供性能评测指导，仅供参考。本章中的评测方法与命令仅供参考；第 3～5 章的部署与服务启动流程是运行本章命令的前提。"

msgid "### 8.1 Using AISBench"
msgstr "### 8.1 使用 AISBench"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Using AISBench for performance "
"evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation) for details."
msgstr ""
"详细内容请参考[使用 AISBench "
"进行性能评测](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
"performance-evaluation)。"

msgid "### 8.2 Using vLLM Benchmark"
msgstr "### 8.2 使用 vLLM Benchmark"

msgid ""
"Refer to [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"更多细节请参考 [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"GSM8K is used to evaluate pure text mathematical reasoning. The `gsm8k` "
"dataset is built into evalscope, downloaded automatically from ModelScope, "
"and includes a 4-shot template and `\\boxed{}` answer extraction. Before "
"evaluating, confirm the text-only service in Section 5.2 is running, and the"
" model name in the client requests must be `dots3_note` (the default model "
"name `default` returns 404)."
msgstr ""
"GSM8K用于评估纯文本数学推理能力。`gsm8k`数据集内置于evalscope中，会自动从ModelScope下载，并包含4-shot模板和`\\boxed{}`答案提取。在评估之前，请确认第5.2节中的纯文本服务正在运行，且客户端请求中的模型名称必须为`dots3_note`（默认模型名称`default`会返回404）。"
